WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Hello and welcome to Milhas Rotadas. If you are here, it is because you want to travel affordably.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:13.200
Here you will find practical, objective modules that guide you step by step to earn points and turn them into miles.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:20.280
There are modules about credit cards, airlines, loyalty clubs and other strategies to help you travel for less.

4
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:26.320
There is also an airline-ticket module to help you take that dream trip of yours.

5
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:33.320
That is it. Make the most of every module, put it into practice, and welcome to Milhas Rotadas.
